{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49867","headline":"蝶恋花 五 · 冯延巳","name":"蝶恋花 五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"六曲阑干偎碧树，杨柳风轻，展尽黄金缕。\n谁把钿筝移玉柱，穿帘海燕双飞去。\n满眼游丝兼落絮，红杏开时，一霎清明雨。\n浓醉觉来莺乱语，惊残好梦无寻处。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"冯延巳","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49867.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49867","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}